  "extraction_notes": "Figure is an optimization table for transamidation of DMF with benzylamine. Standard scheme shows catalyst 1 (10 mol %) and AcOH (20 mol %) in DMF at rt for 24 h to give 3a. Entries 2–4 replace catalyst 1 with 4, 5, or 6, respectively. Entry 8 reports 0% yield; recorded as yield_pct 0 rather than trace/NR. Compound 6 is not drawn in the visible crop; assigned as 2-chlorophenyl-phenylborinic acid based on table text '2-Cl-C6H4B(OH)2, 6' and naming may be uncertain because the printed formula appears shorthand/possibly truncated. DMF functions both as reagent/formyl source and solvent in this figure; it is listed as a reactant and also named in conditions.solvent to preserve the displayed reaction context."
